  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support Balti Legal Clinic Moldova 2023-2026 - Core Support Balti Legal Clinic Moldova 2022-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;d Balti Legal Clinic Moldavien 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges ambassad i Chisinau &#xE5;tog sig att st&#xF6;dja systemutvecklingen av det civila samh&#xE4;llet inom ramen f&#xF6;r ett omfattande k&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;dprogram f&#xF6;r lokala civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer. Legal Clinic Balti valdes ut f&#xF6;r att st&#xF6;djas institutionellt 2023-2026 p&#xE5; grund av sitt k&#xE4;rnuppdrag som vakthund f&#xF6;r att bek&#xE4;mpa och f&#xF6;rebygga korruption i Moldavien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden in Chisinau committed to support the systemic development of civil society within a comprehensive core-support programme for local CSOs. The Legal Clinic Balti was selected to be supported institutionally in 2023-2026 due to its core mandate as a watch-dog in fighting&#xA0;and preventing&#xA0;corruption in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the LC, established for 2022  2026 Development Strategy, is to contribute to improving the quality of justice and respect for human rights in Northern Moldova, and facilitate the access to the most vulnerable groups by extending the result to national level. 
The Clinic has identified strategic objectives in three core areas with the focus on measurable outputs, outcomes and long-term impacts  access to justice program, outreach program, and organizational development.</narrative>
  </description>
